---
import Layout from '../../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

export async function getStaticPaths() {
  const articles = [
    {
      year: '2024',
      month: '05',
      day: '21',
      slug: 'jesus-en-la-tormenta',
      title: 'Jesús en la Tormenta: Encontrando Paz',
      category: 'Vida Cristiana',
      author: 'Pr. Juan Olivera',
      date: '21 de Mayo, 2024',
      readTime: '5 min de lectura',
      image:
        'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuB6N9SSDYTOmaAiLOxR8OwRaTPENcetYYlAB_CfDis1RdmHexkcJbTLcKfHjK2lkpVStbQkl98Z2oYTWCCX5dLIGKuDu08BKMIiG4SyzrT8RngrNA7XAN_0bRoAniLocK_Jqe-hooyHzH9dFF55VrFv3kAfas0HaDOujO8RNlh2kx6VS9kyQA8ne1uVahlVK9wktl5J-I97D7PDytV5RTBkp1wFz-T5OsHg5G66WszMtzXTXLVa-QBnq8WFmWRruiGilU1iZ0xcRCp2',
    },
  ];

  return articles.map((article) => ({
    params: {
      year: article.year,
      month: article.month,
      day: article.day,
      slug: article.slug,
    },
    props: { article },
  }));
}

const { article } = Astro.props;
---

<Layout title={`${article.title} - Iglesia Bautista El Ancla`} isBlog={true}>
  <div class="relative">
    <svg
      class="absolute top-0 right-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-10 dark:opacity-5 w-1/3 h-auto max-w-md"
      viewBox="0 0 200 200"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    >
      <path
        d="M100,0 C120,50 180,50 200,100"
        fill="none"
        stroke="#666"
        stroke-width="1"></path>
      <path
        d="M120,0 C140,60 190,60 200,120"
        fill="none"
        stroke="#666"
        stroke-width="1"></path>
      <path
        d="M140,0 C160,70 200,70 200,140"
        fill="none"
        stroke="#666"
        stroke-width="1"></path>
    </svg>

    <header
      class="relative z-10 container mx-auto px-6 mt-32 mb-10 text-center max-w-4xl"
    >
      <span
        class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-4 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-primary uppercase border border-primary rounded-full bg-primary/5"
      >
        {article.category}
      </span>
      <h1
        class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-display font-bold text-primary-dark leading-tight mb-6"
      >
        {article.title}
      </h1>
      <div
        class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 md:space-x-6 text-sm md:text-base font-sans text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center">
          <span class="material-icons text-primary mr-2 text-lg">edit</span>
          <span>{article.author}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center">
          <span class="material-icons text-primary mr-2 text-lg"
            >calendar_today</span
          >
          <span>{article.date}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center">
          <span class="material-icons text-primary mr-2 text-lg">schedule</span>
          <span>{article.readTime}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <article class="relative z-10 container mx-auto px-6 mb-20 max-w-4xl">
      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-red mx-auto dark:prose-invert font-body">
        <p
          class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans mb-10"
        >
          En medio de las dificultades de la vida, a menudo olvidamos que no
          estamos solos en la barca. La historia de Jesús calmando la tempestad
          no es solo un milagro sobre el clima, es una lección sobre la
          soberanía de Dios sobre nuestro caos.
        </p>
        <img
          alt="Mar tempestuoso y calmo"
          class="w-full h-96 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-lg my-10"
          src={article.image}
        />

        <h2
          class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-12 mb-6"
        >
          La Realidad de las Tormentas
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-loose text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
          Vivimos en un mundo caído donde las tormentas son inevitables. Pueden
          ser problemas financieros, enfermedades, conflictos familiares o
          crisis espirituales. Los discípulos, a pesar de ser pescadores
          experimentados, se llenaron de miedo cuando las olas golpearon la
          barca. Su experiencia y conocimiento no fueron suficientes para
          salvarlos.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-loose text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
          Es interesante notar que Jesús estaba con ellos. <strong
            class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-bold"
            >La presencia de Jesús no garantiza la ausencia de tormentas</strong
          >, pero sí garantiza que llegaremos a la otra orilla.
        </p>

        <blockquote
          class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-6 py-2 my-10 italic text-xl font-display text-primary bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark/50 rounded-r-lg"
        >
          "¿Por qué tenéis tanto miedo? ¿Todavía no tenéis fe? El miedo es a
          menudo un indicador de dónde hemos puesto nuestra confianza."
        </blockquote>

        <h3
          class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4"
        >
          Despertando al Maestro
        </h3>
        <p class="text-lg leading-loose text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
          Mientras la tormenta rugía, Jesús dormía. Esto no era una señal de
          indiferencia, sino de perfecta paz y confianza en el Padre. Cuando los
          discípulos lo despertaron, su pregunta "¿No te importa que
          perezcamos?" refleja nuestro propio corazón en momentos de crisis. A
          menudo cuestionamos el amor de Dios basándonos en nuestras
          circunstancias.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-loose text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
          Al levantarse, Jesús no solo calmó el viento y el mar, sino que
          también confrontó la incredulidad de sus seguidores. La calma exterior
          fue instantánea, pero la lección interior tomaría toda una vida
          aprenderla.
        </p>

        <div
          class="bg-white dark:bg-surface-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm my-12 not-prose relative overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300"
        >
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1.5 h-full bg-primary"></div>
          <div
            class="absolute -right-6 -top-6 text-gray-50 dark:text-neutral-800 opacity-20 dark:opacity-10 transform rotate-12 pointer-events-none group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"
          >
            <span class="material-icons" style="font-size: 140px;"
              >lightbulb</span
            >
          </div>
          <h4
            class="font-display text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-primary relative z-10 flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span class="material-icons text-2xl">auto_awesome</span>
            Para Reflexionar
          </h4>
          <p
            class="mb-0 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed relative z-10"
          >
            ¿Qué tormenta estás enfrentando hoy? ¿Estás tratando de sacar el
            agua de la barca con tus propias fuerzas, o estás dispuesto a
            despertar al Maestro y confiar en Su poder?
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-lg leading-loose text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
          Conocer una iglesia es un gran desafío en estos tiempos, esperamos que
          con la información que encuentres aquí, puedas tener un mayor panorama
          de quiénes somos y lo que creemos. Eres bienvenido a visitarnos cuando
          quieras.
        </p>

        <div
          class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 not-prose font-sans"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 dark:bg-surface-dark dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer border border-transparent dark:border-neutral-700"
            >
              <span class="material-icons text-sm mr-1">local_offer</span> #fe
            </span>
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 dark:bg-surface-dark dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer border border-transparent dark:border-neutral-700"
            >
              <span class="material-icons text-sm mr-1">local_offer</span> #paz
            </span>
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 dark:bg-surface-dark dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer border border-transparent dark:border-neutral-700"
            >
              <span class="material-icons text-sm mr-1">local_offer</span> #confianza
            </span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm"
          >
            <span class="material-icons text-sm mr-1.5">visibility</span>
            <span>1,245 visitas</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section
      class="container mx-auto px-6 mb-24 max-w-3xl border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 pt-8 flex justify-between items-center"
    >
      <div
        class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-neutral-900 dark:text-white"
      >
        Compartir artículo:
      </div>
      <div class="flex space-x-4">
        <button
          class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gray-100 dark:bg-surface-dark flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"
        >
          <span class="material-icons text-sm">link</span>
        </button>
        <button
          class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gray-100 dark:bg-surface-dark flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"
        >
          <span class="material-icons text-sm">facebook</span>
        </button>
        <button
          class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gray-100 dark:bg-surface-dark flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"
        >
          <span class="material-icons text-sm">mail</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 bg-background-light dark:bg-surface-dark relative">
      <div class="absolute left-0 top-10 opacity-10 pointer-events-none">
        <svg
          fill="none"
          height="400"
          viewBox="0 0 200 400"
          width="200"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        >
          <path
            d="M-50 50 C 50 150, 50 250, -50 350"
            stroke="#FF3333"
            stroke-width="2"></path>
          <path
            d="M-30 30 C 70 130, 70 270, -30 370"
            stroke="#FF3333"
            stroke-width="2"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-7xl">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-12">
          <h2
            class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white"
          >
            <span class="text-primary">Más</span> Artículos
          </h2>
          <a
            class="hidden md:flex items-center text-sm font-bold text-primary hover:text-primary-dark transition-colors uppercase tracking-wider"
            href="/blog"
          >
            Ver todo <span class="material-icons text-base ml-1"
              >arrow_forward</span
            >
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <!-- Article Card 1 -->
          <div
            class="group bg-white dark:bg-background-dark rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-soft hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col h-full border border-gray-100 dark:border-neutral-800 transform hover:-translate-y-1"
          >
            <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
              <div
                class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/10 group-hover:bg-black/0 transition-colors duration-300 z-10"
              >
              </div>
              <img
                alt="Biblia abierta"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
                src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDzyuCA4x-kdSgelW1KWc7MNV-aI2cI37TZMJXPK2LcBK7CHXMZ5FMM_Vv9dMZ9aQkm2wmkyE60XM6TMo_-maFNAa6HmpMklC7ZS35vp2IdxZ2xzPQIlhLSoOWtKqPMf6oZhS0Ygp_OsA_9nx2uRIiJnox5_eibeQObhDU7W0NvT0RsILb4T0zw_SymvxQl1vZ0lNlmp9uj6EKbxzQ1AIZAp-i0vJ9o-HBTxBEM8xPH-AwXoBuw6iiuSwko7CcoA2S2byE3FH0Bp5zl"
              />
              <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 z-20">
                <span
                  class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm text-primary text-[10px] font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm"
                  >Serie</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-8 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <div
                  class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-400 mb-3 space-x-2 font-medium"
                >
                  <span class="material-icons text-sm text-primary/60"
                    >calendar_today</span
                  >
                  <span>14 de Mayo, 2024</span>
                </div>
                <h3
                  class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-white leading-tight group-hover:text-primary transition-colors"
                >
                  Hebreos
                </h3>
                <p
                  class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-sans line-clamp-2"
                >
                  Un estudio profundo sobre la supremacía de Cristo y el nuevo
                  pacto.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div
                class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-50 dark:border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-between"
              >
                <div class="flex items-center">
                  <div
                    class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mr-3"
                  >
                    <span class="material-icons text-sm">person</span>
                  </div>
                  <span
                    class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                    >Pr. Juan Olivera</span
                  >
                </div>
                <span
                  class="material-icons text-gray-300 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors"
                  >arrow_forward</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Article Card 2 -->
          <div
            class="group bg-white dark:bg-background-dark rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-soft hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col h-full border border-gray-100 dark:border-neutral-800 transform hover:-translate-y-1"
          >
            <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
              <div
                class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/10 group-hover:bg-black/0 transition-colors duration-300 z-10"
              >
              </div>
              <img
                alt="Comunidad"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
                src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBbc6Aoew9Oa4FG29VrmPPeH5_ryquDLpIMwXDqtzi4XAIzsQmy2xh3xCRzEly2XXrZPfO619eiOP-bTBnnklKfQNE9eNIhaXUHwm0qtcuf-CEtjgxB7PJIzoFVwAfuSoTTV-ykfVepGSJw0acGNOxsqjdAvYfdb7cMGfrmMjQnEREWGMMQsOsIrgXEDxMpYQJ38BSusH_s7FpkWQzKhV1IEdJsAJfoNTya5y-72DvsByD31k2WvHjFlh-DCEQ1vIwGctHCOghyohAN"
              />
              <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 z-20">
                <span
                  class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm text-primary text-[10px] font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm"
                  >Vida</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-8 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <div
                  class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-400 mb-3 space-x-2 font-medium"
                >
                  <span class="material-icons text-sm text-primary/60"
                    >calendar_today</span
                  >
                  <span>07 de Mayo, 2024</span>
                </div>
                <h3
                  class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-white leading-tight group-hover:text-primary transition-colors"
                >
                  La Importancia de la Comunidad
                </h3>
                <p
                  class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-sans line-clamp-2"
                >
                  Por qué fuimos diseñados para vivir nuestra fe acompañados y
                  no en soledad.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div
                class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-50 dark:border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-between"
              >
                <div class="flex items-center">
                  <div
                    class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mr-3"
                  >
                    <span class="material-icons text-sm">person</span>
                  </div>
                  <span
                    class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                    >Pr. Marcos Witt</span
                  >
                </div>
                <span
                  class="material-icons text-gray-300 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors"
                  >arrow_forward</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Article Card 3 -->
          <div
            class="group bg-white dark:bg-background-dark rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-soft hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col h-full border border-gray-100 dark:border-neutral-800 transform hover:-translate-y-1"
          >
            <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
              <div
                class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/10 group-hover:bg-black/0 transition-colors duration-300 z-10"
              >
              </div>
              <img
                alt="Oración"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
                src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuC1HyUHcoHVWm_7iPtDhOJk_JEeGXjT5x6o5aMFsil7JyrJY99qsJdw44ICmW1IbAf2gJ9B4pfxQDUzm9iFovBl7o_AeGwDVIg4G24jLZdRiKysBnvCCNFEez6rLCJC154r3YjwUxFPvxo77BAJIK7w5rs1WehuhyV0Pfy1SS_ir4WtKjWKwv0pqG09PB9w4qLToAItiAG8EVqX3qF5Jl3IpG-Cjg5OBOnFjhUaUJ6e2m7goDJHQRFwkJDxM7KyAlX_9MAzJ2df8gTI"
              />
              <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 z-20">
                <span
                  class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm text-primary text-[10px] font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm"
                  >Oración</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-8 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <div
                  class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-400 mb-3 space-x-2 font-medium"
                >
                  <span class="material-icons text-sm text-primary/60"
                    >calendar_today</span
                  >
                  <span>30 de Abril, 2024</span>
                </div>
                <h3
                  class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-white leading-tight group-hover:text-primary transition-colors"
                >
                  Fundamentos de la Oración
                </h3>
                <p
                  class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-sans line-clamp-2"
                >
                  Redescubriendo el poder de comunicarnos con nuestro Creador
                  diariamente.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div
                class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-50 dark:border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-between"
              >
                <div class="flex items-center">
                  <div
                    class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mr-3"
                  >
                    <span class="material-icons text-sm">person</span>
                  </div>
                  <span
                    class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                    >Pr. Juan Olivera</span
                  >
                </div>
                <span
                  class="material-icons text-gray-300 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors"
                  >arrow_forward</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
